   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Pig Song** (1 other source): Listed as an unreleased track in the setlist [1]\n- **You Were Cool** (1 other source): Identified as an unreleased song in the performance order [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Guys on Every Corner**: rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Only One Way**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Cleaning Crew**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **Hewbrews 11 40**: rare: 13 archived performances [2]\n- **The Pig Song**: back after 114 archived shows (1628 days); rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Clean Slate**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tMG2023-10-03** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 112 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children, banter, John Vanderslice [1]\n- The writer walked to the Belasco in downtown Los Angeles [4]\n- Mikaela Davis performed as a guest at the show [6]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tMG2023-10-03**: taped by @lmgbtapes on tweeter; transferred by @lmgbtapes on tweeter; source: SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston] > PCM-A10 + CA-14 Omnis (Healy on stage, Matt side) > CA-Ugly 2 > PCM-A10 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by UCLA Radio: [The Mountain Goats @ The Belasco 10/3/23](https://uclaradio.com/the-mountain-goats-the-belasco-10-3-23/) [7]",
